<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Flour seeks 15,400T U.S. wheat -- traders.</title>
<headline>Korea Flour seeks 15,400T U.S. wheat -- traders.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Flour Milling Corp on Wednesday invited tenders to buy 15,400 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat by 2 p.m. (0500 GMT), traders said.</p>
<p>They said shipment was set for March 10 to April 10 from the Pacific Northwest to the western port of Mokpo.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
